  "summary_en": "IMO Maritime Safety Committee circular approving interim guidelines for trials of Maritime Autonomous Surface Ships (MASS). It sets objectives for safe, secure, environmentally sound trials: risk management, compliance with mandatory instruments, qualified personnel, human element, infrastructure, third-party awareness, reporting and cyber risk management.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Trials must provide at least the same safety, security and environmental protection as existing IMO instruments.",
   "Flag State authorizes trial ships; coastal/port State authorization where needed.",
   "Risk assessment, emergency plans, and suspension of trials when safety parameters are exceeded.",
   "Remote and onboard operators must be appropriately qualified; human-system interface considered.",
   "Third parties informed, trial details reported, and cyber risk management ensured."
